OL,3,AHelicopter carrying six people crashes
OL,4,Ain northern Indian state
OL,5,
OL,6,FA search for survivors is under way
OL,7,Fafter a helicopter carrying six people,
OL,8,Fincluding five pilgrims, crashed in the
OL,9,Fnorthern Indian state of Uttarakhand,
OL,10,Fofficials say.
OL,12,FUttarakhand's Chief Minister Pushkar
OL,13,FSingh Dhami said the helicopter had
OL,14,Fcrashed near a village close to
OL,15,FJoshimath in Chamoli district. Rescue
OL,16,Fteams have been dispatched to the
OL,17,Fmountainous area, but the condition of
OL,18,Fthose on board remains unclear.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
