OL,3,AHelicopter carrying six people crashes
OL,4,Ain northern Indian state
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe aircraft reportedly took off from
OL,7,Fthe Hindu pilgrimage site of Badrinath
OL,8,Fon Friday afternoon before losing
OL,9,Fcontact.
OL,11,FThe cause of the crash is also not yet
OL,12,Fknown. The incident happened amid
OL,13,Freports of heavy rain and poor
OL,14,Fvisibility in the region.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
